//
// Carried over from `components/utils/usernameValidation.jsx`, with the repairs
// a 2026-09-06 audit of the list itself turned up. Every repair below was
// verified by running the real module, not read off the source:
//
//   * 3 EXACT DUPLICATES removed — `kike`, `raghead`, `blackstink`.
//   * 9 SPACE-BEARING entries de-spaced. Normalization strips separators before
//     comparison, so `'porch monkey'`, `'kill yourself'`, `'death to'`,
//     `'kill all'`, `'gas the'`, `'burn the'` and three others could never match
//     anything. The whole "Hate phrases" section had never fired once.
//   * ~10 TYPOS repaired that left the real target open: `aribssmell` (so
//     `arabssmell` passed), the four misspelled `*stink` variants
//     (`blackpeopletink`, `whitepeoplesink`, `brownpeopleink`,
//     `yellowpeopleink` — every correctly-spelled form passed), the two
//     doubled-s `*skinssmell` entries, `chinktink`, `chinksell`, `venincutter`.
//
// Two mechanical failures are fixed by the MATCHER rather than by editing terms:
// `kkk` and `xxx` used to be unmatchable because normalization clamped runs of
// three to two, and every digit-bearing entry was unmatchable because the leet
// map rewrote digits to letters before comparison. Both now work.
//
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// SCOPE OF THIS FILE
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// This is a repair of a list that already shipped. It deliberately does NOT
// re-litigate which categories a maths puzzle should police — that is a product
// conversation, not an engineering one. The list's content is otherwise as it
// was.

/**
