  },
  {
    id: 'podiumThird', featId: 'podiumThird', mode: 'daily', category: 'competition',
    name: '3rd Place Finishes', hidden: false, scaling: countLadder([1, 10, 37, 100]),
    criteriaText: 'Finish 3rd on the Daily Challenge leaderboard.', art: '🥉', icon: 'medal-3',
  },
  // `firstPodium` was RETIRED in Round 2 § DEDUPE. Its condition — "1st, 2nd or
  // 3rd, for the first time" — is exactly the OR of the three ladders above at
  // tier 0 (each opens at 1), and all four read the same edge-derived
  // `podiumFinishes` counts, so it could never light without one of them
  // lighting too. § D4 had already moved it into this block; this pass removed
  // the duplicate card. See CUT_BADGES in badgeRegistry.test.js.
  // ── EASY DAILY PRESTIGE (David, R2 2026-09-04) ────────────────────────────
  // "Easy already has a real leaderboard, a real podium and a real streak track,
  // so withholding the badges was the odd one out. Easy is also where new
