  ),

  // Fission — The Great Divide, perfected. A nucleus split clean in two, with the
  // seam still glowing between the halves. Deliberately echoes `divide`'s
  // dot-line-dot rhythm turned on its side: the feat IS a division, done perfectly.
  fission: (
    <>
      <circle cx="7.2" cy="12" r="3.4" />
